OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist killed in collision
OL,4,Awith car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died in a collision
OL,7,Fwith a car in North Yorkshire.
OL,9,FThe crash happened on the A171 near
OL,10,FHelwath Beck, between Whitby and
OL,11,FScarborough, shortly after 18:00 BST on
OL,12,F15 September and involved a black Volvo
OL,13,FXC40 and a black and white Triumph
OL,14,FDaytona motorcycle.
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire Police said the biker,
OL,17,Fa man in his 30s from Whitby, died at
OL,18,Fthe scene, while the Volvo driver, a
OL,19,Fwoman in her 40s, suffered minor
OL,20,Finjuries, which did not require
OL,21,Fhospital treatment.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
